<title>UK: Glenmorangie names new finance director.</title>
<headline>Glenmorangie names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotch whisky company Glenmorangie Plc said it has appointed Iain Hamilton as finance director.</p>
<p>Hamilton, currently UK finance director and European financial controller of SCI Europe, will take up his new job on January 6.</p>
<p>He replaces Jim Fyfe who is leaving the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
